{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":53,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["受苦的僕人"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["誰相信我們所傳的呢？",{"text":"耶和華的臂膀向誰彰顯呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂像嫩芽一樣在耶和華面前長大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像生長在旱地裡的根。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂沒有俊美威榮的外表吸引我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有令我們仰慕的容貌。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂被藐視，遭人厭棄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"飽受痛苦，歷盡憂患。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人們對祂不屑一顧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們也不尊重祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"其實祂擔當了我們的憂患，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背負了我們的痛苦。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們卻以為是上帝責罰、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擊打、苦待祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰知祂是因我們的過犯而被刺透，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我們的罪惡而被壓傷。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們因祂所受的刑罰而得到平安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因祂所受的鞭傷而得到醫治。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們都像迷路的羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各人偏行己路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和華卻讓祂承擔我們眾人的罪惡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂遭欺壓、受痛苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻默然不語，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像被人牽去宰殺的羔羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如在剪毛人手下一聲不吭的綿羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂默然不語。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂受到欺壓和審判，被押去處死。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂那個世代的人誰會想到祂受鞭打、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從世上被除去是因為我百姓的過犯呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然祂沒有做過殘暴之事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"口中也沒有詭詐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人卻將祂與惡人同葬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與富人同墓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"然而，祂被壓傷、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"受痛苦是耶和華的旨意；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的性命作了贖罪祭","poem":1},{"noteId":23},{"text":"。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必看見自己的後裔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必長久活著。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的旨意必在祂手中成就。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必看見自己勞苦的成果，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並心滿意足。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「我公義的僕人必憑祂的知識使許多人被算為義人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂要擔當他們的罪惡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我要使祂與偉人同享尊榮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"跟強者同分戰利品，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂獻出了自己的生命。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂被列在罪犯中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻擔當了許多人的罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又為罪犯代求。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":23,"caller":"+","text":"「祂的性命作了贖罪祭」或譯「耶和華以祂的性命作贖罪祭」。","reference":{"chapter":53,"verse":10}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/53.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/54.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/52.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}